# The image installs its own dependencies in the `dependencies` stage. Without this file the
# console stage's `COPY . .` lands the host's node_modules on top of them, which replaces
# linux-musl native binaries — @node-rs/argon2, sharp, esbuild — with the build machine's own.
# The image then builds cleanly and fails at start-up.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output, regenerated inside the image.
.next
**/.next
dist
**/dist
.astro
**/.astro
.turbo
**/.turbo

.git
.github
docs
*.md
!README.md

# Local secrets and state. infra/.env is read by compose on the host, never baked into an image.
infra/.env
.env
.env.*
.seed-credentials.txt

# Test and editor scaffolding.
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
test-results
.vscode
.idea
